---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SEO from '../components/SEO.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en-GB">
  <head>
    <SEO
      title="About the Author — Badreddine"
      description="Meet Badreddine, the writer behind British Home Interior — sharing honest, budget-conscious styling ideas for real British homes and rented flats."
      type="website"
      canonicalPath="/author/"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-KZHMLD9Q"
    height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript>
    <Header />

    <main class="author-page">
      <section class="author-hero">
        <div class="author-hero-inner">
          <div class="author-avatar-circle">
            <img src="/logo.svg" alt="British Home Interior logo" width="72" height="72" />
          </div>
          <span class="author-eyebrow">Written By</span>
          <h1 class="author-heading">Badreddine</h1>
          <p class="author-sub">British home enthusiast · Writing since 2026</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="author-body">
        <div class="author-inner">

          <div class="author-block">
            <h2>Background</h2>
            <p>
              I've always loved interiors, but every time I searched for home styling advice, I found
              American content — dollars instead of pounds, stores that don't ship to the UK, and
              aesthetics built for open-plan houses rather than Victorian terraces and rented London
              flats. British Home Interior is the resource I wished existed when I was styling my first
              flat on a graduate salary.
            </p>
            <p>
              I'm not a professional interior designer. What I bring is genuine enthusiasm and a lot of
              hands-on trial and error — testing real products and layouts, and being honest about what
              actually works in a real British home versus what only looks good on TV makeover shows.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="author-block">
            <h2>What I actually do for this site</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Research and, where possible, test ideas before recommending them — prices and availability checked against UK retailers (Dunelm, IKEA UK, Next Home, John Lewis, Wayfair UK, B&Q, Homebase, Amazon UK)</li>
              <li>Write every guide around British housing realities: period features, tenancy restrictions, and real GBP budgets</li>
              <li>Update posts when prices or product availability change, rather than leaving stale information live</li>
              <li>Reply personally to every message sent through <a href="/contact/">the contact page</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="author-block">
            <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
            <p>
              Full detail on how content here gets researched, written, and corrected is on the
              <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy page</a>. Short version: real research and
              testing where possible, accurate UK pricing always, and no sponsored placements dressed up
              as genuine recommendations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="author-cta">
            <a href="/blog/" class="author-card-btn">Read the Blog →</a>
            <a href="/contact/" class="author-card-btn author-card-btn--ghost">Get in Touch</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
.author-page { background: var(--color-bg); }

.author-hero {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  padding: 5rem 2rem 3.5rem;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.author-hero-inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
.author-avatar-circle {
  width: 88px;
  height: 88px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  background: #fff;
}
.author-avatar-circle img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.author-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-gold);
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.author-heading {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.author-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  margin: 0;
}

.author-body { background: #fff; padding: 4.5rem 2rem 6rem; }
.author-inner { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
.author-block { margin-bottom: 2.75rem; }
.author-block:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
.author-block h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
}
.author-block p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.85;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
}
.author-block p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.author-block a { color: var(--color-gold); }
.author-block ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 1.3rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}
.author-block ul li {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.85;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.author-cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
.author-card-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--color-gold);
  color: #fff;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
  transition: background 200ms;
}
.author-card-btn:hover { background: #9a7f52; color: #fff; }
.author-card-btn--ghost {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.author-card-btn--ghost:hover { background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-heading); }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .author-hero { padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem 2.5rem; }
  .author-body { padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
  .author-cta { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
